00:20:42,380  -->  00:20:43,590
هل لديك أي دليل؟

345
00:20:44,090  -->  00:20:46,550
لطالما احترمتك يا سيد!

346
00:20:49,640  -->  00:20:51,890
سأقول هذا فقط:

347
00:20:51,890  -->  00:20:54,810
أنت لا تدرك موقفك الحالي.

348
00:20:54,810  -->  00:20:59,980
وقد فاز هذا التصميم عين الجمهور بفضل لي واسمي.

349
00:21:00,900  -->  00:21:04,030
إذا كنت تريد البقاء هنا ، فكن حذرًا جدًا بشأن ما تقوله.

350
00:21:08,320  -->  00:21:10,700
في تلك اللحظة ، أقسمت لنفسي ...

351
00:21:12,700  -->  00:21:14,960
أنني لن أسمح له بحضور حفل الجائزة.

352
00:21:18,000  -->  00:21:21,380
ثم ، المطارد الذي قابله هو أنت؟

353
00:21:21,380  -->  00:21:22,510
نعم.

354
00:21:22,510  -->  00:21:25,340
لقد أنشأت مطاردًا وهميًا.

355
00:21:26,630  -->  00:21:30,390
كان كل شيء يسير كما خططت ، موري سان.

356
00:21:31,010  -->  00:21:34,310
كل شيء لكنك تظهر هنا اليوم.

357
00:21:43,030  -->  00:21:48,490
دائما أغنية ماي كوراكي

358
00:21:54,250  -->  00:21:56,080
دائما أعط حبي

359
00:21:56,540  -->  00:21:59,130
دائما أعط حبي لك

360
00:21:59,460  -->  00:22:01,290
دائما أعط حبي

361
00:22:01,750  -->  00:22:04,340
Always give my love to you

362
00:22:04,510  -->  00:22:12,510
son janai ima kara de mo iin janai yareru koto It's not a big thing! From now on there won't be any problems! We can make it

363
00:22:14,640  -->  00:22:23,230
omotta doori ni yatte miyou kimi to deau made Let's give it a go. Like we wanted to, until I met you

364
00:22:24,730  -->  00:22:29,910
nani mo nakatta keredo me o tojite omou I had nothing, but I closed my eyes and I could believe...

365
00:22:30,030  -->  00:22:34,580
issho ni ikiru basho ga aru kara Because there is a place, where you and I always can be together

366
00:22:34,870  -->  00:22:41,130
always ai no mune ni yuuki o dashite Always have courage and love, in your heart

367
00:22:41,380  -->  00:22:45,760
tatoe sore ga dame da to shite mo ne Even if you think it's no use

368
00:22:45,880  -->  00:22:51,140
No sore dake ga jibun janai No, that's just not like me

369
00:22:51,260  -->  00:22:56,680
Yes kazamuki ga kawatta ima tobitatou Yes, now that the direction of the wind has changed, let's fly!

370
00:22:56,810  -->  00:22:58,560
Always give my love

371
00:22:59,060  -->  00:23:01,690
Always give my love to you

372
00:23:00,400  -->  00:23:02,520
Always give my love

373
00:23:01,980  -->  00:23:09,320
Always give my, give my love

374
00:23:16,370  -->  00:23:18,000
What's wrong, Ran-neechan?

375
00:23:18,500  -->  00:23:22,460
I don't know if I will ever be able to trust people that are self-proclaimed geniuses.

376
00:23:23,290  -->  00:23:25,840
Then, you don't trust me?

377
00:23:27,300  -->  00:23:31,590
Imagine that the great Mouri Kogoro is not the one solving all these cases.

378
00:23:32,300  -->  00:23:34,180
